1183:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The system frequency computed by this function is not the real
1184:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         frequency in the chip. It is calculated based on the predefined
1185:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *         constant and the selected clock source:
1186:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is MSI, function returns a value based on MSI
1187:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *             Value as defined by the MSI range.
1188:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSI, function returns values based on HSI_VALUE(*)
1189:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is HSE, function returns a value based on HSE_VALUE(**)
1190:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     If SYSCLK source is PLL, function returns a value based on HSE_VALUE(**)
1191:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *           or HSI_VALUE(*) multiplied/divided by the PLL factors.
1192:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (*) HSI_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32l0xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
1193:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *               16 MHz) but the real value may vary depending on the variations
1194:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *               in voltage and temperature.
1195:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note     (**) HSE_VALUE is a constant defined in stm32l0xx_hal_conf.h file (default value
1196:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                8 MHz), user has to ensure that HSE_VALUE is same as the real
1197:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                frequency of the crystal used. Otherwise, this function may
1198:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *                have wrong result.
1199:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   *
1200:Drivers/STM32L0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l0xx_hal_rcc.c ****   * @note   The result of this function could be not correct when using fractional
